    "title": "Leyin aye buburu  yi.",
    "author": "Christ Apostolic Church (CAC) Worldwide",
    "verses": [
      "Leyin aye buburu  yi.\nAye ekun on osi yi,\nIbi rere kan wa.\nAyida ko si nibe,\nKo s' oru f'osan titi.\nWi mi 'wo o wa nibe?",
      "Lekun ogo re ti m'ese,\nLati b'iberu sin Oluwa,\nT'won ko nsaani aye;\nAwon t'a f' Emi mimo to,\nAwon t'o nrin l'ona tooro,\nAwon ni o wa nibe,"
    ],
